      "mergeID": "630041d3274ac0449d59098d",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Since VR users already have a camera I thought it'd be nice for desktop users to have one. There's several ways it can be implemented for example the user can angle the camera like an in game object and can decide how far away with a scroll bar in an added menu along with filters and such in the same menu. Considering most users in VRChat are on Desktops this would be beneficial to add. Another way this can be implemented by allowing users to edit the location of the camera with an X, Y, Z axis.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Cameras for Desktop Users",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
